@startuml AB_Granite_Business_Flow!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false

title AB Granite Quarry ERP - Key Business Process Flows (v1.1)

' ============================================================================
' FLOW 1: PRODUCTION FLOW
' ============================================================================
|#E6FFE6|Mining Operations|
start
:Planning: Geological Survey & Mine Planning (M23);
note right
  Input: Lease area, mineable zones
  Output: Mining plan, bench layout
end note

:Drilling: Drill holes for blasting;
note right
  Equipment: Drilling rig
  Parameters: Hole depth, diameter, spacing
end note

:Blasting: Execute blast (M2);
note right
  PESO licence verification
  Blaster certificate check
  Explosives register update
  Vibration monitoring
  Yield estimation
end note

:Extraction: Extract blocks from quarry face (M1);
note right
  Equipment: Excavator, crane
  Location: Bench level
  GPS coordinates logged
end note

:Measurement: Measure blocks (L×W×H);
note right
  Calculate gross CBM
  Calculate net CBM (wastage adjustment)
  Digital calipers / measuring tape
end note

:Identification: Assign block number & QR code (M3);
note right
  Block No: {QUARRY_CODE}/{YEAR}/{SEQUENCE}
  Example: ABG/2026/00451
  RFID tagging (optional)
  Photo capture (4 sides)
end note

:Stockyard: Move to stockyard location;
note right
  Location tracking
  GPS coordinates
  Stock register update
end note

|#FFE6E6|Quality & Grading|
:Visual Inspection: Grade & color classification (M24);
note right
  Grade: A, B, C, Commercial
  Color: Paradiso, Black Galaxy, etc.
  Variety assignment
end note

if (Export quality?) then (yes)
  :Lab Testing: Density, compressive strength, water absorption;
else (no)
  :Skip lab tests;
endif

:Update Block Status: Available for sale;
stop

' ============================================================================
' FLOW 2: SALES & DESPATCH FLOW (DOMESTIC)
' ============================================================================
|#FFF9E6|Sales|
start
:Customer Inquiry;

:Quotation: Send rate per CBM (M7);
note right
  Rate varies by variety & grade
  Customer-specific pricing
  Validity period
end note

:Sales Order: Create SO (M7);
note right
  Input: Customer, variety, qty, rate
  Block reservation: Specific blocks tagged to SO
  Advance payment terms
end note

if (Advance received?) then (yes)
  :Payment Receipt: Record advance in GL (M11);
else (no)
  :Credit approval required;
  stop
endif

|#E6F3FF|Despatch|
:Block Allocation: Assign specific blocks to SO;

:Weighbridge: Weigh vehicle (tare) (M9);
note right
  Empty truck weight
  Vehicle details capture
end note

:Loading: Load blocks onto truck;
note right
  Supervisor verification
  Photo/video evidence
  GPS timestamp
end note

:Weighbridge: Weigh loaded vehicle (gross) (M9);
note right
  Gross weight
  Net weight = Gross - Tare
  Weight slip generation
end note

:Invoice Generation: Create GST invoice (M7);
note right
  HSN: 2516 (Granite)
  GST Rate: 5%
  CGST 2.5% + SGST 2.5% (intra-state)
  IGST 5% (inter-state)
end note

|#FFDDDD|Compliance|
:E-Way Bill: Generate EWB from NIC portal (M10);
note right
  Required if invoice value > ₹50,000
  Distance-based validity
  Vehicle number mandatory
end note

:E-Invoice: Generate IRN via IRP (M10);
note right
  Required if turnover > ₹5 crore
  IRN + QR code on invoice
  Auto-sent to GST portal
end note

:Mineral Despatch Permit (MDP): TN Mining Dept (M19);
note right
  Required for all mineral despatches
  Online portal submission
  MDP register maintained
end note

:Gate Pass: Issue gate pass with all documents;
note right
  Documents:
  - Invoice (original + copies)
  - E-Way Bill
  - MDP
  - Weight slip
  - Delivery challan
end note

:Gate Out: Vehicle exit from quarry;
note right
  GPS coordinates logged
  Gate management system (M26)
  CCTV footage
end note

stop

' ============================================================================
' FLOW 3: EXPORT SALES FLOW
' ============================================================================
|#FFF9E6|Export Sales|
start
:Export Inquiry: Overseas buyer;

:Proforma Invoice: Send PI with terms;
note right
  Currency: USD/EUR
  Incoterms: FOB/CIF
  Payment: LC/Advance
end note

:Export Sales Order: Create export SO (M8);
note right
  Buyer country
  Port of loading (Chennai/Tuticorin)
  Shipping line
  Container details
end note

:LC Receipt / Advance Payment;

|#E6F3FF|Stuffing & Shipping|
:Block Preparation: Quality check & documentation;

:Stuffing: Load container at quarry/port;
note right
  Container No.
  Seal No.
  Packing list
  Photo/video evidence
end note

:Commercial Invoice: Export invoice (zero-rated GST);
note right
  GST Rate: 0% (IGST on exports)
  LUT declaration
  GSTIN of exporter
end note

:Shipping Bill: File with Customs (ICEGATE) (M8);
note right
  Port: Chennai/Tuticorin
  HS Code: 25161100
  Customs clearance
  CHA coordination
end note

:Bill of Lading (BL): Issued by shipping line;

|#FFDDDD|Post-Shipment|
:EDPMS Upload: Export data (M8);
note right
  DGFT portal
  Shipping bill details
  BL details
  Mandatory for export incentives
end note

:Bank Realization: Foreign exchange (FIRC);
note right
  AD-code bank
  FIRC certificate
  Forex gain/loss accounting
end note

stop

' ============================================================================
' FLOW 4: ROYALTY & COMPLIANCE FLOW
' ============================================================================
|#E6F9F9|Monthly Royalty|
start
:End of Month: Production reconciliation;

:Prepare Royalty Return: Calculate royalty (M15);
note right
  Opening stock (previous month closing)
  + Production (current month)
  - Despatch (current month)
  = Closing stock
  
  Royalty = Despatch × Rate per CBM
  DMF = Royalty × 10-30%
  NMET = Royalty × 2%
end note

:Internal Approval: CFO/Director sign-off;

:Payment: Pay royalty + DMF + NMET (M11);
note right
  Payment mode: Online/Challan
  Bank: State Treasury
  Reference No. capture
end note

:TN Mining Portal: Upload royalty return (M15);
note right
  Portal: Tamil Nadu Mining Department
  Attach challan/payment proof
  Monthly return submission
end note

|#FFDDDD|Quarterly Compliance|
:DGPS Survey: Submit quarterly DGPS coordinates (M15);
note right
  Surveyor engagement
  Topographic survey
  Boundary verification
  Within lease area check
end note

:Upload to IBM: Submit Form F1 data (M15);
note right
  IBM portal (Indian Bureau of Mines)
  Monthly production data
  Quarterly DGPS
end note

|#FFDDDD|Annual Compliance|
:Form H1: Annual return to IBM (M15);
note right
  Due: 30th April (for previous year)
  Production summary
  Employment details
  Safety statistics
  Machinery details
end note

:Star Rating: MCDR 2017 compliance (M15);
note right
  Self-assessment questionnaire
  Environmental management
  Safety practices
  Target: 3-star or higher
end note

stop

' ============================================================================
' FLOW 5: PAYROLL FLOW
' ============================================================================
|#FFEEEE|HR & Payroll|
start
:Daily Attendance: Biometric capture (M14);
note right
  Devices: Biometric/RFID
  Shifts: Day/Night/General
  Geo-fencing validation
end note

:End of Month: Payroll processing;

:Calculate Gross Pay: Basic + DA + HRA + Allowances;
note right
  Wages per day or monthly salary
  OT calculation (1.5× or 2× rates)
  Attendance-based computation
end note

:Calculate Statutory Deductions (M16);
note right
  EPF (Employee): 12% of basic
  EPF (Employer): 12% of basic
  ESI (Employee): 0.75% of gross (if < ₹21,000)
  ESI (Employer): 3.25% of gross
  Professional Tax: ₹200 (TN)
  TDS: As per Income Tax Act
end note

:Calculate Net Pay: Gross - Deductions;

:Payslip Generation: Email to employees;

:Bank Transfer: Salary credit via NEFT/IMPS;
note right
  Salary account details
  Payment date: 5th of next month
end note

|#FFDDDD|Statutory Compliance|
:EPF Return: ECR upload to EPFO portal (M16);
note right
  Due: 15th of next month
  Member-wise contribution
  Challan payment
end note

:ESI Return: Upload to ESIC portal (M16);
note right
  Due: 15th of next month
  Contribution payment
end note

:Form 16: Issue to employees (annual);
note right
  TDS certificate
  Due: 15th June
end note

stop

' ============================================================================
' FLOW 6: PROCUREMENT FLOW
' ============================================================================
|#E6FFE6|Procurement|
start
:Purchase Requisition: Dept head raises PR (M6);
note right
  Item details
  Quantity required
  Delivery location (quarry)
  Budget code
end note

if (Stock item?) then (yes)
  :Check Inventory: Current stock vs reorder level;
  if (Below reorder level?) then (no)
    stop
  endif
else (no)
endif

:Quotation Request: Send RFQ to suppliers;
note right
  Minimum 3 quotations
  Technical specifications
  Delivery terms
end note

:Quotation Comparison: Commercial & technical evaluation;

:Purchase Order: Issue PO to selected supplier (M6);
note right
  PO No., Date
  Item, Qty, Rate
  Delivery terms
  Payment terms
end note

|#FFE6E6|Goods Receipt|
:Goods Receipt: Inspect & accept (M6);
note right
  Physical verification
  Quality check
  Quarry-wise GRN
  Stock update
end note

:Supplier Invoice: Receive GST invoice;

:Invoice Verification: 3-way match (PO, GRN, Invoice);

if (Match OK?) then (yes)
  :Approve for Payment;
else (no)
  :Query/Return to supplier;
  stop
endif

|#F0E6FF|Payment|
:Payment Voucher: Record liability (M11);
note right
  Credit: Supplier account
  Debit: Expense/Asset account
  Quarry & cost center allocation
  TDS deduction (if applicable)
end note

:Payment Processing: Pay via bank (M13);
note right
  NEFT/RTGS
  Payment advice
  TDS challan (if TDS deducted)
end note

:Close PO: Mark PO as completed;

stop

legend bottom right
  **Module References:**
  M1: Production & Drilling
  M2: Blasting
  M3: Blocks & Stockyard
  M6: Procurement & Inventory
  M7: Domestic Sales
  M8: Export Sales
  M9: Weighbridge
  M10: E-Way Bill & E-Invoice
  M11: General Ledger
  M13: Banking & Treasury
  M14: Payroll
  M15: Mining Statutory Compliance
  M16: Labour Statutory Compliance
  M19: Permits & MDP
  M23: Geological & Mine Planning
  M24: Quality Lab
  M26: Gate Management
end legend

@enduml!theme plain
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #E6F3FF

title AB Granite - Business Process Flow

|Purchase|
start
:Receive supplier\nquotation;
:Create Purchase Order;
note right
  • Select variety
  • Quantity (CBM)
  • Rate per CBM
  • Transport charges
end note
:Approve PO;

|Warehouse|
:Receive blocks\nat yard;
:Inspect & register\neach block;
note right
  Block details:
  • L×W×H measurements
  • CBM calculation
  • Location
  • Photo
end note
:Update status\nto "available";

|Production|
:Select block\nfor cutting;
:Create cutting job;
:Cut block\ninto slabs;
:Register slabs;
note right
  Slab details:
  • L×W×T measurements
  • SqFt calculation
  • Grade (A/B/C)
  • Finish type
  • Link to block
end note

if (Job work?) then (yes)
  :Send to\njob worker;
  :Create JW order;
  :Receive finished;
  :Update status;
else (no)
endif

:Mark "available";

|Sales|
:Customer inquiry;
:Create quotation;
note right
  • Select variety
  • Quantity in SqFt
  • Rate per SqFt
  • Validity
end note

if (Approved?) then (yes)
  :Convert to SO;
  :Reserve slabs;
  :Create GST Invoice;
  note right
    Auto-calculate:
    • CGST/SGST or IGST
    • Generate IRN
    • QR code
  end note
  :Generate PDF\nwith IRN;
  :Mark slabs "sold";
  
  |Accounts|
  :Record payment;
  
  if (Full payment?) then (yes)
    :Status = "paid";
  else (partial)
    :Status = "partial";
  endif
  
  :Auto journal entry;
  note right
    Dr. Bank A/C
    Cr. Sales A/C
  end note
  
  stop
else (no)
  :Mark "expired";
  stop
endif

|Finance|
fork
  :Month-end;
  :P&L Report;
  :Balance Sheet;
fork again
  :GST compliance;
  :GSTR-1;
  :GSTR-3B;
  :File returns;
fork again
  :Inventory report;
  :Stock valuation;
  :Aging analysis;
end fork

stop

@enduml
